  "summary": [
    "Model boundary: observed reality versus last confirmed index are distinct",
    "Table of logical information, identifiers, sources and relations",
    "Document info is stored once per document ID and shared across keys",
    "Confirmed ToC holds only per-key data: version, target spec, members, back references",
    "Multiplicities: documents belong to multiple keys, one confirmed ToC per key",
    "Section identification by section IDs at heading ends",
    "Document ID differs from content hash; link definition lines excluded from hash",
    "Reference check results hold only for the recorded directory and time",
    "Documents leaving the target are removed from the confirmed ToC without searching outside",
    "No unresolved relations remain"
  ],
